-Sessions never expire.
+## Session expiry
+
+Each saved session records an `issued_at` timestamp. Sessions expire after `SESSION_TTL`
+(3600 seconds, defined in `sessionsvc.store`). `load_session` rejects an older session with
+`SessionExpiredError` and first calls `purge_expired()`, which deletes expired (or unreadable)
+entries from the on-disk cache. Resume blobs are base64-encoded JSON, not pickle.
